Summary

The scientific program is now physically defensible and methodologically ordered. The Diviner operator propagates calibration uncertainty. The PSR energy balance includes earthshine and starlight. The geothermal flux prior reflects polar heat-flow estimates. The parameter space is reduced to three dimensions. The inference strategy distinguishes exact PDE constraints from penalized violations. The first deliverable is an identifiability atlas, not a reconstruction error. The framework identifies fundamental limitations before any machine learning is involved.


